<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Wings She Carried</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œYeah, I know.â€ I let out a sigh and lean a little harder on my forearms. On the garden tiers below us, a group of children play tag between the towers of the topiary. Not a care in the world to disturb their rambunctiousness. â€œI always try to be happy outside even when I donâ€™t feel it inside. Every morning, Iâ€™d wake up and breathe in a new day and push down doubts and insecurities. It can beâ€¦ exhausting honestly.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora studies me, the golden object in her hand momentarily forgotten, a deep furrow to her brow. The expression sends a wave of doubt through me and I immediately backpedal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhat? Did I say something weird? Jeez, Iâ€™m sorry. I do that sometimes.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œNoâ€¦ justâ€¦â€ She shakes her head slowly and drops her eyes to hands again. â€œWaking up happy. Iâ€™ve never really tried to do that before. There were a lot of mornings when I could have used that. I wonderâ€¦â€ Her words falter and she clutches the curio tightly in a fist before letting out a long breath. She looks like a woman who has arisen from a fight, scarred but victorious. Burdened beneath an unshakable weariness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She needs some cheering up. Good thing Scorpia is on the job.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>4theHonourofGrÃ¤yskÃ¼ll (AVAwolfpack), But_Its_For_Science (DakianDelomast), DakianDelomast</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
